			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Gamified Pattern Recognition Training in a Real-Time Market Simulator",
					"simStepId": "1043bd03-09b0-4b3e-b851-466370158c71"
				}
			]
		},
		"6280130a-fa34-469d-b705-a8ecd6116551": {
			"path": "6280130a-fa34-469d-b705-a8ecd6116551",
			"cellName": "Backend Creates Session Record - start.ts:L13-42",
			"cellId": "6280130a-fa34-469d-b705-a8ecd6116551",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "12c95067-011b-470a-b201-b4f53ede9045"
		},
		"src/routes/api/session/start.ts-simstep-bfe6205d-1a9c-4654-a941-edf999c3883c": {
			"path": "src/routes/api/session/start.ts-simstep-bfe6205d-1a9c-4654-a941-edf999c3883c",
			"fileName": "start.ts",
			"wiki": "The backend API route `/api/session/start` receives the request. It verifies the user's session, generates a unique session ID, and inserts a new record into the `sessionResults` table with initial values (score 0, accuracy 0, etc.).",
			"cellName": "Backend Creates Session Record - start.ts:L13-42",
			"cellId": "6280130a-fa34-469d-b705-a8ecd6116551",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 13,
			"endLine": 42,
			"parentCellId": "12c95067-011b-470a-b201-b4f53ede9045",
			"parentPath": "src/routes/api/session/start.ts",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Gamified Pattern Recognition Training in a Real-Time Market Simulator",
					"simStepId": "bfe6205d-1a9c-4654-a941-edf999c3883c"
				}
			]
		},
		"1852eaa1-696b-456d-a93e-c44b5a88b7b9": {
			"path": "1852eaa1-696b-456d-a93e-c44b5a88b7b9",
			"cellName": "Initialize & Start Web Worker - play.tsx:L6-188",
			"cellId": "1852eaa1-696b-456d-a93e-c44b5a88b7b9",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "06c3e0b0-c42c-497e-ba13-f1ef363d6c64"
		},
		"src/routes/play.tsx-simstep-55d946ed-ed4a-4d99-85cd-9cf71c729264": {
			"path": "src/routes/play.tsx-simstep-55d946ed-ed4a-4d99-85cd-9cf71c729264",
			"fileName": "play.tsx",
			"wiki": "Back on the frontend, `play.tsx` receives the new session ID. It then posts a `START` message to the `SimulatorWorker`, which has already been initialized with historical candlestick data. This begins the simulation loop.",
			"cellName": "Initialize & Start Web Worker - play.tsx:L6-188",
			"cellId": "1852eaa1-696b-456d-a93e-c44b5a88b7b9",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 6,
			"endLine": 188,
			"parentCellId": "06c3e0b0-c42c-497e-ba13-f1ef363d6c64",
			"parentPath": "src/routes/play.tsx",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Gamified Pattern Recognition Training in a Real-Time Market Simulator",
					"simStepId": "55d946ed-ed4a-4d99-85cd-9cf71c729264"
				}
			]
		},
		"ca8700cb-fe2c-4d82-b03b-c4c091197bb0": {
			"path": "ca8700cb-fe2c-4d82-b03b-c4c091197bb0",
			"cellName": "Worker Detects Candlestick Pattern - simulator.worker.ts:L398-408",
			"cellId": "ca8700cb-fe2c-4d82-b03b-c4c091197bb0",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "741fcd40-3e89-4f6e-a788-62ec28637f40"
		},
		"src/game/simulator.worker.ts-simstep-69590880-7f76-4cf5-af93-6ea6e2b8ef22": {
			"path": "src/game/simulator.worker.ts-simstep-69590880-7f76-4cf5-af93-6ea6e2b8ef22",
			"fileName": "simulator.worker.ts",
			"wiki": "The `SimulatorWorker`'s `tick` function determines it is time to generate a quiz. It calls `generateQuiz`, which gathers the recent candlestick data and passes it to `PatternService.detectPatterns` to find a recognizable pattern.",
			"cellName": "Worker Detects Candlestick Pattern - simulator.worker.ts:L398-408",
			"cellId": "ca8700cb-fe2c-4d82-b03b-c4c091197bb0",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 398,
			"endLine": 408,
			"parentCellId": "741fcd40-3e89-4f6e-a788-62ec28637f40",
			"parentPath": "src/game/simulator.worker.ts",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Gamified Pattern Recognition Training in a Real-Time Market Simulator",
					"simStepId": "69590880-7f76-4cf5-af93-6ea6e2b8ef22"
				}
			]
		},
		"1a3c0143-bc25-44ca-a1ac-dffca1ef8e49": {
			"path": "1a3c0143-bc25-44ca-a1ac-dffca1ef8e49",
			"cellName": "Display Quiz Dialog - play.tsx:L184-191",
			"cellId": "1a3c0143-bc25-44ca-a1ac-dffca1ef8e49",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "06c3e0b0-c42c-497e-ba13-f1ef363d6c64"
		},
		"src/routes/play.tsx-simstep-d75b7b17-d79e-4ee8-b2cc-962f6700b757": {
			"path": "src/routes/play.tsx-simstep-d75b7b17-d79e-4ee8-b2cc-962f6700b757",
			"fileName": "play.tsx",
			"wiki": "The `play.tsx` component receives the `QUIZ_EVENT` message. It pauses the simulation, updates its state with the quiz data, and renders the `QuizDialog` component, which displays the question and multiple-choice answers to the user.",
			"cellName": "Display Quiz Dialog - play.tsx:L184-191",
			"cellId": "1a3c0143-bc25-44ca-a1ac-dffca1ef8e49",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 184,
			"endLine": 191,
			"parentCellId": "06c3e0b0-c42c-497e-ba13-f1ef363d6c64",
			"parentPath": "src/routes/play.tsx",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Gamified Pattern Recognition Training in a Real-Time Market Simulator",
					"simStepId": "d75b7b17-d79e-4ee8-b2cc-962f6700b757"
				}
			]
		},
		"ad996492-5345-455b-ba02-53dec59a5ae1": {
			"path": "ad996492-5345-455b-ba02-53dec59a5ae1",
			"cellName": "Worker Scores Answer - simulator.worker.ts:L486-528",
			"cellId": "ad996492-5345-455b-ba02-53dec59a5ae1",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "741fcd40-3e89-4f6e-a788-62ec28637f40"
