			"fileName": "ChartView.tsx",
			"wiki": "A `createEffect` in `ChartView` observes the `data` prop. When the prop updates with a new candle, the effect calls the `series.update()` method from the Lightweight Charts API to append the candle to the series, creating a smooth, animated playback.",
