			"description": "<ul><li>This is the core feature of the application, providing significant business value through user engagement and skill development</li><li>- Users engage in a real-time simulation where historical market data is played back on a candlestick chart</li><li>- The application automatically detects candlestick patterns as they form and triggers timed, multiple-choice quizzes to test the user's recognition skills</li><li>- A sophisticated scoring system tracks performance, including points, streaks, and accuracy, which are saved at the end of each session</li><li>- User performance on specific patterns is tracked to adapt future quizzes, focusing on areas where the user is weakest</li></ul>",
