			"description": "<ul><li>This feature provides the foundational knowledge required for the gamified training, acting as the primary user acquisition and learning tool</li><li>- The application offers structured educational content on trading concepts, categorized into topics like basics, patterns, psychology, and risk</li><li>- Each lesson is followed by a multiple-choice quiz to reinforce the concepts learned</li><li>- User progress, including completion status and quiz scores, is tracked and stored in the database</li><li>- The system can recommend lessons to users based on their progress and performance, creating a personalized learning path</li></ul>",
