			"description": "<ul><li>This use case drives user retention by providing clear feedback on their learning journey and adapting the experience to their skill level</li><li>- The system tracks user mastery for each specific trading pattern, calculating accuracy and a <code>weight</code> value over time</li><li>- This weight is used to implement adaptive difficulty, presenting patterns the user struggles with more frequently during gamified sessions</li><li>- A dedicated profile page displays key performance statistics, such as lessons completed, average quiz accuracy, and total game sessions played</li><li>- After each game session, users are shown a detailed summary of their performance, including which patterns they answered correctly or incorrectly</li></ul>",
