					"simStepLabel": "Data Flow: Propagate Updated Data to Chart",
					"simStepDescription": "SolidJS's reactivity system detects the change in the `animatedData` signal and automatically passes the updated array (now with one more candle) as a prop to the `ChartView` component.",
