					"simStepLabel": "Handle Quiz Event and Set Highlight State",
					"simStepDescription": "The `onmessage` handler in `play.tsx` receives the `QUIZ_EVENT`. It sets the `currentQuiz` signal with the payload, which makes the quiz dialog appear and provides the pattern data needed for highlighting.",
