					"simStepLabel": "Calculate and Render Highlight Overlay",
					"simStepDescription": "The `PatternHighlight` component receives the pattern data. Its `createEffect` hook runs, using the chart and series APIs to convert the pattern's candle indices and price range into exact pixel coordinates. It then renders a styled `div` as an overlay to visually highlight the pattern area on the chart.",
