			"description": "<ul><li>This is a foundational technical feature that enables the core gamified quiz and paper trading experiences</li><li>- The application fetches historical candlestick data from a database via a dedicated API endpoint, with caching at the edge for performance</li><li>- It uses the 'Lightweight Charts' library to render interactive, high-performance financial charts</li><li>- A web worker runs the simulation, feeding candlestick data to the chart tick-by-tick to create an animated playback experience without blocking the UI</li><li>- The chart view can dynamically highlight specific patterns during quizzes to draw the user's attention to the relevant candles</li></ul>",
