			"description": "<ul><li>A fundamental requirement that enables all personalized features like progress tracking and mastery levels</li><li>- Users can create an account using an email and password, with password hashing for security</li><li>- The application uses Auth</li><li>js with a database session strategy, allowing users to sign in and maintain persistent sessions</li><li>- Authenticated users have a profile page to view their account information and learning statistics</li><li>- All user-specific data, such as lesson progress and quiz results, is securely associated with their account</li></ul>",
