		"Paper Trading Simulation": {
			"name": "Paper Trading Simulation",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simStepId": "bae439c5-43ae-439b-9b1e-37f76a5a5446",
					"diagramNodeId": "7490b405-7ec6-40db-8282-d3a5f257c2ab",
					"simStepLabel": "Database Schema: Define Simulated Portfolios",
					"simStepDescription": "The system defines the structure for the `portfolios` table using Drizzle ORM. This table is designed to store each user's paper trading accounts, including their starting balance, current equity, and leverage settings. This is the foundational data structure for the paper trading simulation feature.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "src/db/schema.ts",
						"startLine": "145",
						"endLine": "162",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"portfolios",
							"sqliteTable",
							"text",
							"real",
							"integer"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "null",
					"outputDataExample": "{\n  \"id\": \"folio_a7b2c9d8\",\n  \"userId\": \"user_e6f5g4h3\",\n  \"name\": \"My First Paper Account\",\n  \"startingBalance\": 50000,\n  \"currentBalance\": 50000,\n  \"equity\": 50000,\n  \"leverage\": 5.0,\n  \"maxPositionSize\": 0.05\n}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "509a8424-7f14-478f-a62a-c8b48adf9d4a",
					"diagramNodeId": "0682c884-2bc8-444c-872c-f87fd276a9e2",
					"simStepLabel": "Data Definition: Portfolio to Order Relationship",
					"simStepDescription": "The schema definition logically connects portfolios to their associated orders. The `orders` table includes a `portfolioId` field that creates a foreign key reference to a specific portfolio's ID, establishing the one-to-many relationship necessary for tracking trades within an account.",
					"isEdge": 1,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "src/db/schema.ts",
						"startLine": "166",
						"endLine": "168",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"orders.portfolioId",
							"portfolios.id"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\n  \"portfolioId\": \"folio_a7b2c9d8\"\n}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\n  \"portfolioId\": \"folio_a7b2c9d8\"\n}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "f87913ca-8a06-4f04-aa97-9ae6f7e21faa",
					"diagramNodeId": "68ab3f97-3cb0-4d85-b5e1-9153a61c005a",
					"simStepLabel": "Database Schema: Define Trade Orders",
					"simStepDescription": "The system defines the structure for the `orders` table. This table is designed to store details for each simulated trade, such as the associated portfolio, the symbol being traded (e.g., BTC/USD), order type (market, limit), side (long/short), quantity, prices, status, and the final realized profit or loss (PnL).",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "src/db/schema.ts",
						"startLine": "164",
						"endLine": "184",
						"relevantVariables": [
